{"3693150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Office Bot Simulator", "steam_appid": 3693150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The integration of AI into everyday life has already begun, including attempts to replace humans in advanced workflows. You are a robot secretary, and everyone is watching closely to see if you can handle the job better than a human. Therefore, be good, avoid mistakes that could discredit not only you but the very idea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693150/extras/a8aaf48784c50faf0b3ef7309946b359.avif?t=1760073682\" width=1366 height=768 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Office Routine</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assistance: Watering plants, documents for signing, mail, coffee, meetings, calls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PC Work: Files, business trips, training, investments, and much more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693150/extras/f9d1ca147a66d4a49979a4fe96d47bdc.avif?t=1760073682\" width=1366 height=768 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Office rules</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonuses for impeccable work and penalties for mistakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Termination if the number of failures exceeds a critical point.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day brings more tasks—will you be able to keep up the pace?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693150/extras/7a8fce6039187838950cb23eda8688e4.avif?t=1760073682\" width=1366 height=768 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Life after work</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expenses: Payment for maintenance, electricity, internet, insurance, and everything else.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades: Improve your speed, battery, and intelligence.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693150/extras/3ae9295f832346d2c701f45b6b626c4b.avif?t=1760073682\" width=1366 height=768 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The integration of AI into everyday life has already begun, including attempts to replace humans in advanced workflows. You are a robot secretary, and everyone is watching closely to see if you can handle the job better than a human. Therefore, be good, avoid mistakes that could discredit not only you but the very idea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693150/extras/a8aaf48784c50faf0b3ef7309946b359.avif?t=1760073682\" width=1366 height=768 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Office Routine</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assistance: Watering plants, documents for signing, mail, coffee, meetings, calls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PC Work: Files, business trips, training, investments, and much more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693150/extras/f9d1ca147a66d4a49979a4fe96d47bdc.avif?t=1760073682\" width=1366 height=768 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Office rules</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonuses for impeccable work and penalties for mistakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Termination if the number of failures exceeds a critical point.</p>